# TDD Workflow

## Ciclo Red-Green-Refactor

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                 │
│    ┌───────┐     ┌───────┐     ┌──────────┐    │
│    │  RED  │ --> │ GREEN │ --> │ REFACTOR │    │
│    └───────┘     └───────┘     └──────────┘    │
│        │                             │         │
│        └─────────────────────────────┘         │
│                                                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### 1. RED - Escreva Teste que Falha
```java
@Test
void should_ThrowException_When_UserNotFound() {
    // Arrange
    when(repository.findById(99L)).thenReturn(Optional.empty());

    // Act & Assert
    assertThrows(UserNotFoundException.class,
        () -> service.findById(99L));
}
```
Run: `mvn test` - DEVE FALHAR

### 2. GREEN - Codigo Minimo para Passar
```java
public User findById(Long id) {
    return repository.findById(id)
        .orElseThrow(() -> new UserNotFoundException(id));
}
```
Run: `mvn test` - DEVE PASSAR

### 3. REFACTOR - Melhorar Mantendo Verde
- Extrair metodos
- Renomear para clareza
- Remover duplicacao
- Run: `mvn test` - DEVE CONTINUAR PASSANDO

## Naming Convention

```java
void should_ExpectedBehavior_When_Condition()

// Exemplos
void should_ReturnUser_When_ValidIdProvided()
void should_ThrowException_When_UserNotFound()
void should_CreateUser_When_ValidRequest()
void should_Return401_When_InvalidToken()
```

## Test Structure (AAA)

```java
@Test
void should_CreateUser_When_ValidRequest() {
    // Arrange - Setup
    CreateUserRequest request = CreateUserRequest.builder()
        .email("test@example.com")
        .name("Test User")
        .build();
    when(repository.save(any())).thenReturn(testUser);

    // Act - Execute
    UserResponse result = service.create(request);

    // Assert - Verify
    assertNotNull(result);
    assertEquals("test@example.com", result.getEmail());
    verify(repository).save(any());
}
```

## Test Annotations

| Annotation | Uso | Context |
|------------|-----|---------|
| `@WebMvcTest(Controller.class)` | Controllers | Web layer only |
| `@DataJpaTest` | Repositories | JPA + H2 |
| `@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)` | Services | Unit test |
| `@SpringBootTest` | Integration | Full context |

## Coverage Requirements

- **80%+** em codigo novo
- **Excluidos**: DTOs, configs, models, utils, mappers
- Verificar: `mvn test jacoco:report`

## O Que Testar

### TESTAR
- Business logic
- Validation rules
- Error handling
- Edge cases
- Security constraints

### NAO TESTAR
- Framework code (Spring, Hibernate)
- Third-party libraries
- Simple getters/setters
- Auto-generated code (MapStruct impls)
